---
layout: base.njk
navActive: docs
title: "Examples"
description: "Real exchanges with a connected AI, each one start to finish: what was asked, the tools that answered, and what you need to set it up."
permalink: /examples/index.html
canonical: /examples
---
{#- The examples' own front door (redesign step 7): the bar used to go straight
    to the first one. Seven here, three listed under Build in the rail. The
    leads are each example's own lede, from _data/examples.js. -#}
{%- set railOn = "examples" %}
{%- set railTop = "connect" %}
{%- set railHere = "All examples" %}
{%- set railOutline = [] %}
<div class="siterail siterail--docs">
  {% include "docs-rail.njk" %}
  <div class="siterail__body">
    <nav class="docs__crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/docs">Docs</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Connect an AI</span><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Examples</span>
    </nav>
    <h1 class="hero-title docs__title">Examples</h1>
    <p class="docs__lede">{{ description }}</p>
    {%- for g in examples %}{% if g.group != "For builders" %}
    <section class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 18px">
      <div class="panel__head"><h2 style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0">{{ g.group }}</h2></div>
      {%- for c in g.cases %}
      <a class="examples-row" href="/examples/{{ c.key }}">
        <span class="examples-row__title">{{ c.label }}</span>
        <span class="examples-row__lede">{{ c.lede | safe }}</span>
        <span class="examples-row__go">Read it</span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </section>
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    <p class="footnote">
      Three more are for builders: Answer your clanmates, Publish your own stats and Run a collector.
      <a href="/docs/agents">Build &amp; reference &rsaquo;</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<script defer src="{{ "/assets/site-rail.js" | asset }}"></script>
